    <briefdescription>
<para>Platform services. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every member may be NULL; the library then works without that service:</para>
<para><table rows="5" cols="3"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Member   </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Used for   </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>NULL means    </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>lock   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>mutual exclusion of the Control Tables   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>single context (bare metal)    </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>unlock   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>(pair of lock)   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para></para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>millis   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Realtime Tick (120), Bus Watchdog (98)   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>tick 0, no watchdog timeout    </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>delay_us   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Return Delay Time (9) before a status   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>status sent at once   </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para>The bus keeps a pointer to the port: keep it alive as long as the bus. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
